
* =====================================================
* EXPERIMENT 2B - SRAM BUTTERFLY CURVE
* Idealized complementary inverter characteristics
* =====================================================

* DC sweep input
VSW X 0 0

* First inverter characteristic (falling curve)
B1 Y1 0 V=1.8/(1+exp((V(X)-0.75)/0.04))

* Complementary characteristic (rising curve)
B2 Y2 0 V=1.8/(1+exp((0.75-V(X))/0.04))

* Sweep input from 0V to 1.8V
.dc VSW 0 1.8 1m

.save V(X) V(Y1) V(Y2)

.end
